      "kind": "fenced_code",
      "start_line": 25,
      "end_line": 33,
      "raw": "```qml\nimport LVRS 1.0 as LV\n\nLV.WheelScrollGuard {\n    anchors.fill: parent\n    targetFlickable: innerFlick\n    consumeInside: true\n}\n```\n",
